                          "_key": "KYwlUTD9",
                          "_type": "span",
                          "marks": [],
                          "text": "Thirty years after the events of the first film, a new blade runner, LAPD Officer K, unearths a long-buried secret that has the potential to plunge what's left of society into chaos. K's discovery leads him on a quest to find Rick Deckard, a former LAPD blade runner who has been missing for 30 years."
                        }
