                          {
                            "_key": "9WH9b6NF",
                            "_type": "span",
                            "marks": [],
                            "text": "Bound for a remote planet on the far side of the galaxy, the crew of the colony ship 'Covenant' discovers what is thought to be an uncharted paradise, but is actually a dark, dangerous world – which has its sole inhabitant the 'synthetic', David, survivor of the doomed Prometheus expedition."
